 z=x['summary'];lines.append(f'- Door{x["door_angle_deg"]}degrees: **{z["sampled_poses"]}/{z["sampled_poses"]} sampled poses rejected by obstacle collision**; self-collision poses{z["self_collision_poses"]}, unintended tray/robot collision poses{z["unintended_tray_collision_poses"]}, payload/obstacle collision poses{z["payload_collision_poses"]}. The first reported obstacle is the original-role open door. The undersized-aperture control was detected.')
